{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Lotto\u200b</strong>\u200b is an idle placement game where you can literally do nothing. At regular intervals, the game automatically triggers a \u200b<strong>\u200blottery ticket drop\u200b</strong>\u200b, rewarding players with random-tier tickets. Lower-tier tickets can be synthesized into higher-tier ones, while higher-tier tickets can also be \u200b<strong>\u200bdecomposed back into lower-tier tickets without any loss\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014ensuring zero resource waste during conversion.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749270?t=1758562998","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749270?t=1758562998","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749270/443a5bb28842c3daa38d12987455af8b8c4465fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758562998","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749270/443a5bb28842c3daa38d12987455af8b8c4465fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758562998","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Lotto\u200b</strong>\u200b is an idle placement game where you can literally do nothing. At regular intervals, the game automatically triggers a \u200b<strong>\u200blottery ticket drop\u200b</strong>\u200b, rewarding players with random-tier tickets. Lower-tier tickets can be synthesized into higher-tier ones, while higher-tier tickets can also be \u200b<strong>\u200bdecomposed back into lower-tier tickets without any loss\u200b</strong>\u200b\u2014ensuring zero resource waste during conversion.</p>","developers":["tcplay"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste